  Quote(id: 635, text: "It is curious that physical courage should be so common in the world, and moral courage so rare.", author: "Mark Twain", category: "Courage"),
  Quote(id: 636, text: "Perseverance, dear my lord, keeps honour bright.", author: "William Shakespeare", category: "Perseverance"),
  Quote(id: 637, text: "If you want to be happy, set a goal that commands your thoughts, liberates your energy, and inspires your hopes.", author: "Andrew Carnegie", category: "Goals"),
  Quote(id: 638, text: "Heaviness in the heart of man maketh it stoop: but a good word maketh it glad.", author: "Proverbs 12:25", category: "Bible"),
  Quote(id: 639, text: "The only way to make sense out of change is to plunge into it, move with it, and join the dance.", author: "Alan Watts", category: "Courage"),
  Quote(id: 640, text: "Lose an hour in the morning, and you will spend all day looking for it.", author: "Richard Whately", category: "Action"),
  Quote(id: 641, text: "Nothing in life is to be feared, it is only to be understood. Now is the time to understand more, so that we may fear less.", author: "Marie Curie", category: "Fear"),
  Quote(id: 642, text: "Never say never, because limits, like fears, are often just an illusion.", author: "Michael Jordan", category: "Perseverance"),
  Quote(id: 643, text: "Don't be pushed around by the fears in your mind. Be led by the dreams in your heart.", author: "Roy T. Bennett", category: "Fear"),
  Quote(id: 644, text: "What lies behind us and what lies before us are tiny matters compared to what lies within us.", author: "Henry S. Haskins", category: "Motivation"),
  Quote(id: 645, text: "The LORD is my shepherd; I shall not want.", author: "Psalms 23:1", category: "Bible"),
  Quote(id: 646, text: "Behold the turtle. He makes progress only when he sticks his neck out.", author: "James Bryant Conant", category: "Courage"),
  Quote(id: 647, text: "Set your course by the stars, not by the lights of every passing ship.", author: "Omar Bradley", category: "Goals"),
  Quote(id: 648, text: "Done is better than perfect.", author: "Sheryl Sandberg", category: "Success"),
  Quote(id: 649, text: "Happiness is the consequence of personal effort.", author: "Elizabeth Gilbert", category: "Happiness"),
